    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, im a parent of a 7 year old and we've been seeing a lot of stuff in the news lately about gender identity and how it's different from biological sex. i want to make sure i'm being a good parent and teaching them the right things. how can i explain the concept of gender identity to my kid in a way that is age-appropriate and actually correct?",
